  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400°F (200°C).",
    "Thread the meat and vegetables onto skewers, leaving some space between each piece.",
    "In a small bowl, mix together smoked paprika, cumin, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Brush the skewers with olive oil and sprinkle the spice mixture evenly.",
    "Place the skewers on a baking sheet lined with parchment paper.",
    "Roast the skewers in the preheated oven for 12-15 minutes, or until cooked through and slightly charred.",
    "Remove the skewers from the oven and let them rest for 2-3 minutes.",
    "Garnish with chopped cilantro and serve hot."
